    "name": "UltraBravoRPG",
    "steam_appid": 3522290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra Bravo RPG is a pixelated comedy RPG in which you explore a three-dimensional map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while battling enemies by pressing buttons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(1)Press the button to attack the enemy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the button in front of the enemy! Pressing a button mashing! etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the buttons appropriately to attack enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If successful, it can deal a lot of damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/48c32a0356b65487e6976424bfd5eb9a.avif?t=1744430745\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the button in front of the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/18d7384a809746cee0a3d6c963adebcc.avif?t=1744430745\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressing a button mashing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(2)Press the button at the right time to block enemy attacks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This alone makes it a standard action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, in this game, attacks come from above, below, left, right, and above your head!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To block an attack you need to press the corresponding button!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/9bb576baa8ddcb46a6500e8836c8e404.avif?t=1744430745\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the right button to block attacks coming from the right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/c34845ad5bd6c05cd4523bf29a722f22.avif?t=1744430745\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the down button to block attacks coming from below!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/f66ac779938aff77af684469facd1843.poster.avif?t=1744430745\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/f66ac779938aff77af684469facd1843.webm?t=1744430745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/f66ac779938aff77af684469facd1843.mp4?t=1744430745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you need to guess the direction of attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(3)The dungeon is a three-dimensional map!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You progress by jumping and attacking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also falling floors and moving lifts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can also be enjoyed as a 3D action game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/943c38f2c3011ff59e573bd97ba3d2d9.avif?t=1744430745\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >jumping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/7b713d47bcf9aab33121fea659e7a5de.avif?t=1744430745\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New actions may also be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(4)An adventure with comedy and happiness!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in the Kingdom of Shizukani, a country inhabited by only idiots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nabeo and his no-good friends cause mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a great adventure with laughs and no tears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The estimated completion time is 8 hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/81e8878ef482264e81baa70fbe7b2930.avif?t=1744430745\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/3a8c59858930d1a91228146915154a26.avif?t=1744430745\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/6ddd179d5bcbc271cbda2030ad3bce91.avif?t=1744430745\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >encounter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522290/extras/db3c66ec0ed8725cf1d8e439300ad0a6.avif?t=1744430745\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >seaweed</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Basic operations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff3a\uff08ActionButton\uff09\uff1aAttack, Decide, Examine, Talk, Guard\uff08During the battle\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff38\uff08JumpButton\uff09\u3000\uff1aJump, cancel, fast forward dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff23\uff08PauseButton\uff09\u3000\u3000\uff1aOpen/close the pause menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff21\uff08SelectButton\uff09\u3000\uff1aSwitch field actions, display detailed explanations\uff08During the battle\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys\uff1aCharacter movement, selection cursor movement, guard\uff08During the battle\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bButton assignments can be changed in the config menu under [Button Config].</p>",
